<FONT SIZE="3"><B>Meeting notes</B></FONT><BR><BR>

- The alternate meeting dates were discussed. The poll from the past week suggested that a majority of the members were happy with the Sunday meeting time. To avoid confusion for now, the meetings will stay on Sunday at 9est. If you can't make the meeting, you can pay your dues anytime during the week by messaging Dantes, or another officer.
<p>
- Bakin stated that newbie WOULD be happening this week. Listen in game for details. All are welcome to participate and have fun.
<p>
- The statue saga update was given. Valorblade now has a statue, although it almost drove Olmo mad while it was in his possession.
<p>
- Annubi explained his plans for becoming the guild jeweler. He is already a master but still needs more practice to move through the rest of the gold items and into platinum. He was given a 500 plat grant from the guild to continue his studies.
<p>
- Omenn was given a 900 plat loan to buy a Ghoulbane. He will repay it when he sells his Deepwater Harpoon.
<p> 
- Zulagin was welcomed into the guild. His sponsor was Benni, although she wasn't at the meeting so Pyndraegon took her place.


